    test: key the OBS-3 outcomes mock on the daemon executor file:// href
    
    The daemon loads PipelineExecutor via an absolute file:// URL built from its own
    module (getPipelineExecutorCandidates), so the test-relative vi.mock specifier
    never registered and the REAL executor ran bun install/tsc/bun test nested
    inside the unit test: both cases timed out at 30s and the file was red on main.
    
    Verified: 2 passed in <1s (was 2 failed, 60s of nested pipeline runs).
    
    Co-authored-by: Alexis Okuwa <wojonstech@gmail.com>
---
 tests/daemon/daemon-prom-outcomes.test.ts | 11 +++++++++--
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

